</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, speak Thy Word, upon us breathe,</l><l>Revive the bones with quickening breath,</l><l>That we may leave our graves, our death;</l><l>Lord, speak and breathe upon us!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, speak Thy Word, upon us breathe,</l><l>Thy people all to make alive,</l><l>A mighty host, the foe to drive;</l><l>Lord, speak and breathe upon us!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, speak Thy Word, upon us breathe,</l><l>That all Thy people may be one,</l><l>Led by the headship of the Son;</l><l>Lord, speak and breathe upon us!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Lord, speak Thy Word, upon us breathe,</l><l>Thy people fitly frame with grace</l><l>To be Thy rest, Thy dwelling-place;</l><l>Lord, speak and breathe upon us!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Lord, speak to me, upon me breathe,</l><l>Revive me, in Thy Body build,</l><l>No more secluded and self-willed;</l><l>Breathe now, O Lord, upon me!</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Lord, speak to me, upon me breathe</l><l>That with Thy saints the foe I’ll fight,</l><l>That in Thy house Thou may delight,</l><l>Breathe now, O Lord, upon me!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
